  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Services in the areas of donor engagement, science and technology, and program support for the Bureau for Policy, Planning, and Learning.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Services Provided: Under this PASA, USDA FAS Office of Capacity Building and Development will provide technical staff to assist USAID&apos;s Office of Donor Engagement, Office of Science and Technology, and the Office of the Assistant DIrector to carry out their technical leadership in food security; climate change; donor engagement and outreach; policy formulation and implementation; program planning and management; monitoring and evaluation; and science, technology and innovation. OCBD will also provide administrative support to the PASA technical staff so that they can effectively carry out their tasks in support of USAID.</narrative>
  </description>
